      "source": "samples/runbooks/checkout-timeout.md",
      "title": "Checkout Timeout Runbook",
      "content": "Use this runbook when checkout requests time out while waiting on the inventory service. Symptoms: Payment or checkout API requests fail with TimeoutException. The failing route is usually /checkout. Logs mention waiting for inventory reservation or stock confirmation. Immediate checks: Confirm inventory service health and request latency. Check the checkout API outbound timeout and retry settings. Compare timeout spikes with inventory deployment or database saturation events. Recommended action: Reduce checkout retry fan-out, verify inventory capacity, and fail gracefully with a retryable user-facing message until inventory latency returns to baseline.",
      "tags": ["checkout", "timeout", "payments"],
      "serviceName": "checkout-api",
      "component": "payments",
      "releaseName": "0.1",
      "isActive": true,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
          "position": 0,
          "text": "Use this runbook when checkout requests time out while waiting on the inventory service. Payment or checkout API requests fail with TimeoutException. Logs mention inventory reservation, stock confirmation, request latency, retry settings, database saturation, and checkout retry fan-out."
